# RoboVault NEXUS Frontend - Production Environment Variables
# Configure this in your Vercel Project Settings > Environment Variables

# The base URL for the RoboVault REST API.
# - If your Spring Boot / Node API is hosted at https://api.robovault.example.com, set:
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.robovault.example.com/api
# - If using a reverse proxy on the same domain, default is /api:
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api

